  aorTotalDebit Decimal [not null, default: 0]
  aorTotalCredit Decimal [not null, default: 0]
  aorDifference Decimal [not null, note: 'GENERATED ALWAYS AS (debit - credit) STORED — read-only. The one number
everybody reads off this table is the one nobody can write incorrectly.
Non-zero means the carried trial balance did not agree.

dbgenerated() is the closest Prisma has to a generated column: it has no
attribute for one, and this at least keeps the field out of the create
input and the schema free of drift. Postgres rejects a write to it.']
  aorOverwriteManual Boolean [not null, default: false, note: 'Whether this run was allowed to overwrite MANUAL openings. The single
