  company companys [not null]
  branch branch_master

  Note: 'One row per carry-forward run, never updated — the history that
fiscal_years overwrites. fyIsCarriedForward / fyCarriedForwardAt record
THAT a year was carried forward and WHEN, once; a regenerate overwrites the
timestamp, and the numbers that say whether the run was sound — rows
created, manual openings stepped around, the Dr/Cr totals and the
difference between them — were returned to the caller and then lost.

Deliberately NOT partitioned by accounting year: a run is keyed by the two
years it spans rather than living inside either, and it grows by a handful
of rows a year. Added by migration 20260915090000 (DECISION 11).'
}

